<hr>
<h6 id=3D"-1-where--filters-rows-before-grouping">=F0=9F=9F=A2 1. <code>WHE=
RE</code> =E2=80=94 filters <strong>rows</strong>, <em>before</em> grouping=
</h6>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">SQL</span></div><pre><code class=3D"=
hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">SELECT</span> department, <span class=3D=
"hljs-built_in">COUNT</span>(<span class=3D"hljs-operator">*</span>) <span =
class=3D"hljs-keyword">AS</span> emp_count
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">FROM</span> employees
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">WHERE</span> salary <span class=3D"hljs-operat=
or">&gt;</span> <span class=3D"hljs-number">50000</span>          <span cla=
ss=3D"hljs-comment">-- each ROW is checked on its own salary</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">GROUP</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">BY</=
span> department;</code></pre></div>
<p>What <code>WHERE</code> does to each row:</p>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">diff</span></div><pre><code class=3D=
"hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-addition">+ Asha | Engineering | 80000   =E2=9C=
=85 kept</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-addition">+ Ben  | Engineering | 60000   =E2=9C=85 kept=
</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-deletion">- Chen | Engineering | 40000   =E2=9D=8C not =
&gt; 50000</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-addition">+ Dia  | Sales       | 55000   =E2=9C=85 kept=
</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-deletion">- Eli  | Sales       | 30000   =E2=9D=8C not =
&gt; 50000</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-deletion">- Fay  | Sales       | 35000   =E2=9D=8C not =
&gt; 50000</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-deletion">- Gus  | HR          | 45000   =E2=9D=8C not =
&gt; 50000</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-deletion">- Hana | HR          | 48000   =E2=9D=8C not =
&gt; 50000</span></code></pre></div>
<p><strong>Result</strong> =E2=80=94 the 3 surviving rows are grouped and c=
ounted:</p>
<div class=3D"tbl"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th style=3D"text-align:left">department</th>
<th style=3D"text-align:right">emp_count</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style=3D"text-align:left">=F0=9F=9F=A6 Engineering</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:right">2</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style=3D"text-align:left">=F0=9F=9F=A9 Sales</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:right">1</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
<p>=F0=9F=92=A1 HR vanishes completely =E2=80=94 none of its <em>rows</em> =
passed the filter.</p>
<hr>
<h6 id=3D"-2-having--filters-groups-after-grouping">=F0=9F=94=B5 2. <code>H=
AVING</code> =E2=80=94 filters <strong>groups</strong>, <em>after</em> grou=
ping</h6>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">SQL</span></div><pre><code class=3D"=
hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">SELECT</span> department, <span class=3D=
"hljs-built_in">AVG</span>(salary) <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">AS</span> a=
vg_salary
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">FROM</span> employees
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">GROUP</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">BY</=
span> department
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">HAVING</span> <span class=3D"hljs-built_in">AV=
G</span>(salary) <span class=3D"hljs-operator">&gt;</span> <span class=3D"h=
ljs-number">50000</span>;   <span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- the condition i=
s on the GROUP&#x27;s average</span></code></pre></div>
<p>All 8 rows are grouped first, <em>then</em> <code>HAVING</code> judges e=
ach group as a whole:</p>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">diff</span></div><pre><code class=3D=
"hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-addition">+ Engineering | AVG =3D 60000 | (80000=
, 60000, 40000)   =E2=9C=85 kept</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-deletion">- Sales       | AVG =3D 40000 | (55000, 30000=
, 35000)   =E2=9D=8C not &gt; 50000</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-deletion">- HR          | AVG =3D 46500 | (45000, 48000=
)          =E2=9D=8C not &gt; 50000</span></code></pre></div>
<p><strong>Result:</strong></p>
<div class=3D"tbl"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th style=3D"text-align:left">department</th>
<th style=3D"text-align:right">avg_salary</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style=3D"text-align:left">=F0=9F=9F=A6 Engineering</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:right">60,000</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
<p>=F0=9F=92=A1 No individual row was removed =E2=80=94 Chen's 40,000 still=
 counted towards Engineering's average. Whole groups were dropped instead.<=
/p>
