<tbody>
<tr>
<td style=3D"text-align:left">Looks at</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:left">one <strong>row</strong> at a time</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:left">one whole <strong>group</strong> at a time</t=
d>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style=3D"text-align:left">Runs</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:left">=E2=8F=AA before <code>GROUP BY</code></td>
<td style=3D"text-align:left">=E2=8F=A9 after <code>GROUP BY</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style=3D"text-align:left">Aggregates (<code>AVG</code>, <code>COUNT</co=
de>=E2=80=A6)</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:left">=E2=9D=8C not allowed</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:left">=E2=9C=85 allowed</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style=3D"text-align:left">Typical condition</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:left"><code>salary &gt; 50000</code></td>
<td style=3D"text-align:left"><code>AVG(salary) &gt; 50000</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style=3D"text-align:left">Effect on group math</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:left">rows removed <strong>change</strong> the aggr=
egates</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:left">aggregates are computed <strong>first</strong=
>, unchanged</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style=3D"text-align:left">Speed</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:left">=E2=9A=A1 shrinks data early, can use indexes=
</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:left">=F0=9F=90=A2 works on already-grouped data</t=
d>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
