ontrol Language">4. DCL =E2=80=94 Data Control Language</h3>
<p><strong>Purpose:</strong> Manage <strong>permissions and access control<=
/strong> =E2=80=94 who can do what on which database objects.</p>
<div class=3D"markdown-alert markdown-alert-important"><p class=3D"markdown=
-alert-title"><svg class=3D"octicon octicon-report mr-2" viewBox=3D"0 0 16 =
16" version=3D"1.1" width=3D"16" height=3D"16" aria-hidden=3D"true"><path d=
