<td>Data Query Language</td>
<td>Read/fetch data</td>
<td><code>SELECT</code></td>
<td>Nothing (read-only)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>DML</strong></td>
<td>Data Manipulation Language</td>
<td>Insert/update/delete data</td>
<td><code>INSERT</code>, <code>UPDATE</code>, <code>DELETE</code></td>
<td>Data</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>DCL</strong></td>
<td>Data Control Language</td>
<td>Manage permissions</td>
<td><code>GRANT</code>, <code>REVOKE</code></td>
<td>Access</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>TCL</strong></td>
<td>Transaction Control Language</td>
<td>Manage transactions</td>
<td><code>BEGIN</code>, <code>COMMIT</code>, <code>ROLLBACK</code>, <code>S=
AVEPOINT</code></td>
<td>Transaction state</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
<div class=3D"markdown-alert markdown-alert-note"><p class=3D"markdown-aler=
t-title"><svg class=3D"octicon octicon-info mr-2" viewBox=3D"0 0 16 16" ver=
sion=3D"1.1" width=3D"16" height=3D"16" aria-hidden=3D"true"><path d=3D"M0 =
8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 0 1 0 8Zm8-6.5a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 0 13 6.5 6.5 0 0 0 0-13=
ZM6.5 7.75A.75.75 0 0 1 7.25 7h1a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.75h.25a.75.75 0 0 1 =
0 1.5h-2a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h.25v-2h-.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75ZM8 6a1 1 0 1 1=
 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z"></path></svg>Note</p><p><strong>Auto-commit note:</str=
ong> DDL commands (<code>CREATE</code>, <code>DROP</code>, <code>TRUNCATE</=
code>) are <strong>auto-committed</strong> =E2=80=94 they take effect immed=
iately and cannot be rolled back. DML commands (<code>INSERT</code>, <code>=
