<h4 id=3D"which-operations-use-which-algorithm">Which Operations Use Which =
Algorithm?</h4>
<div class=3D"tbl"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Operation</th>
<th>Algorithm</th>
<th style=3D"text-align:center">Concurrent DML?</th>
<th>Notes</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><strong>Add column (at end)</strong></td>
<td><code>INSTANT</code> (8.0+) =E2=9A=A1</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9C=85 Yes</td>
<td>Only metadata change =E2=80=94 no data rewrite</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Add column (at position)</strong></td>
<td><code>INSTANT</code> (8.0.29+) =E2=9A=A1</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9C=85 Yes</td>
<td><code>ALTER TABLE t ADD COLUMN c INT AFTER b</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Drop column</strong></td>
<td><code>INSTANT</code> (8.0.29+) =E2=9A=A1</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9C=85 Yes</td>
<td>Metadata-only in newer versions</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Rename column</strong></td>
<td><code>INSTANT</code> =E2=9A=A1</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9C=85 Yes</td>
<td>Just a metadata change</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Set/drop default value</strong></td>
<td><code>INSTANT</code> =E2=9A=A1</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9C=85 Yes</td>
<td>Metadata only</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Add index</strong></td>
<td><code>INPLACE</code></td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9C=85 Yes</td>
<td>Reads table data to build the index, but the table stays writable</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Drop index</strong></td>
<td><code>INSTANT</code> =E2=9A=A1</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9C=85 Yes</td>
<td>Just metadata</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Add a foreign key</strong></td>
<td><code>INPLACE</code></td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9C=85 Yes</td>
<td>Requires <code>foreign_key_checks=3D0</code> or <code>LOCK=3DNONE</code=
></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Change <code>VARCHAR</code> size (within 255)</strong></td>
<td><code>INPLACE</code></td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9C=85 Yes</td>
<td>Growing past the 255-byte length prefix forces a <code>COPY</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Change column data type</strong></td>
<td><code>COPY</code> =F0=9F=90=8C</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9D=8C No</td>
<td>Must rewrite every row =E2=80=94 full lock</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Convert charset</strong></td>
<td><code>COPY</code> =F0=9F=90=8C</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9D=8C No</td>
<td>Must rewrite every row</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Add <code>FULLTEXT</code> index</strong></td>
<td><code>INPLACE</code></td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9D=8C No (blocks writes)</td>
<td>Reads are allowed, writes are blocked</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Change <code>ROW_FORMAT</code></strong></td>
<td><code>COPY</code> =F0=9F=90=8C</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9D=8C No</td>
<td>Full table rebuild</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
<h4 id=3D"=EF=B8=8F-the-metadata-lock-mdl-trap--this-catches-everyone">=E2=
=9A=A0=EF=B8=8F The Metadata Lock (MDL) Trap =E2=80=94 This Catches Everyon=
e</h4>
<p>Even though the ALTER itself is &quot;online&quot;, <code>INSTANT</code>=
 and <code>INPLACE</code> operations still need a brief <strong>metadata lo=
ck</strong> at the start and end. It's usually held for microseconds =E2=80=
=94 but here's the catch.</p>
<p>If there's a <strong>long-running query or uncommitted transaction</stro=
ng> on that table, the ALTER will <strong>wait</strong> for the metadata lo=
ck. And while the ALTER is waiting, <strong>all new queries queue up behind=
 it</strong>:</p>
