</section><section class=3D"sec"><h2 id=3D"-what-is-schema-migration-prisma=
-django-rails-etc" data-toc=3D"4. What is Schema Migration? (Prisma, Django=
, =E2=80=A6"><span class=3D"sec-n">4.</span> =E2=9D=93 What is Schema Migra=
tion? (Prisma, Django, Rails, etc.)</h2>
<p><strong>Schema migration</strong> is the process of <strong>versioning a=
nd applying changes to your database schema</strong> (tables, columns, inde=
xes, constraints) in a controlled, repeatable way =E2=80=94 just like Git t=
racks changes to your code, migrations track changes to your database struc=
ture.</p>
<h3 id=3D"the-problem-migrations-solve" data-toc=3D"The Problem Migrations =
Solve">The Problem Migrations Solve</h3>
<p>Without migrations, schema changes are chaos:</p>
<figure class=3D"diagram"><img class=3D"fig" src=3D"data:image/svg+xml;base=
64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI3NjAiIGhl=
