<h3 id=3D"prisma-migrate-dev-vs-db-push" data-toc=3D"Prisma: migrate dev vs=
 db push">Prisma: <code>migrate dev</code> vs <code>db push</code></h3>
<div class=3D"tbl"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th></th>
<th style=3D"text-align:center"><code>prisma migrate dev</code></th>
<th style=3D"text-align:center"><code>prisma db push</code></th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><strong>Creates migration files?</strong></td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9C=85 Yes (versioned SQL)</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9D=8C No</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Uses tracking table?</strong></td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9C=85 <code>_prisma_migrations</code></=
td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9D=8C Ignores it</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Safe for production?</strong></td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9C=85 Yes</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9D=8C No</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Best for</strong></td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">Teams, CI/CD, production</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">Quick prototyping, throwaway DBs</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
