</section><section class=3D"sec"><h2 id=3D"-what-does-seed-a-database-mean"=
 data-toc=3D"5. What Does &quot;Seed a Database&quot; Mean?"><span class=3D=
"sec-n">5.</span> =E2=9D=93 What Does &quot;Seed a Database&quot; Mean?</h2=
>
<p><strong>Seeding</strong> means <strong>populating a database with initia=
l/sample data</strong> so it's not empty after creation. Think of it like p=
lanting seeds in a garden =E2=80=94 you're putting the initial data in so y=
our app has something to work with.</p>
