</section><section class=3D"sec"><h2 id=3D"-mysql-pagination--offsetlimit-v=
s-cursor-based-keyset-pagination" data-toc=3D"6. MySQL Pagination =E2=80=94=
 OFFSET/LIMIT vs Cursor-Based =E2=80=A6"><span class=3D"sec-n">6.</span> =
=E2=9D=93 MySQL Pagination =E2=80=94 OFFSET/LIMIT vs Cursor-Based (Keyset) =
Pagination</h2>
<p>=F0=9F=94=97 <a href=3D"https://planetscale.com/blog/mysql-pagination" t=
arget=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener">PlanetScale =E2=80=94 MySQL Pagination</a=
></p>
<p>When you have millions of rows and need to show them page by page (like =
a product listing or infinite scroll feed), <strong>how</strong> you pagina=
te matters enormously.</p>
<h3 id=3D"approach-1-offsetlimit-the-na=C3=AFve-way" data-toc=3D"Approach 1=
: OFFSET/LIMIT (The Na=C3=AFve Way)">Approach 1: OFFSET/LIMIT (The Na=C3=AF=
ve Way)</h3>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">SQL</span></div><pre><code class=3D"=
