n> <span class=3D"hljs-number">10000</span>;</code></pre></div>
<p><strong>The Problem:</strong> MySQL must <strong>scan and discard</stron=
g> all <code>OFFSET</code> rows before returning your <code>LIMIT</code> ro=
ws. So <code>OFFSET 10000</code> means MySQL reads 10,020 rows but throws a=
way 10,000 of them.</p>
