<h4 id=3D"step-2--the-fix-paginate-the-index-then-fetch-the-rows">Step 2 =
=E2=80=94 The Fix: Paginate the Index, Then Fetch the Rows</h4>
<p>Split the query into two halves:</p>
<ol>
<li><strong>The narrow half</strong> =E2=80=94 find <em>which</em> 20 IDs y=
ou need, touching only the index.</li>
<li><strong>The wide half</strong> =E2=80=94 fetch full rows for <strong>on=
ly those 20 IDs</strong>.</li>
</ol>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">SQL</span></div><pre><code class=3D"=
hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- =E2=9C=85 DEFERRED JOIN</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">SELECT</span> p.<span class=3D"hljs-operator">=
*</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">FROM</span> products <span class=3D"hljs-keywo=
rd">AS</span> p
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">INNER</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">JOIN=
</span> (
    <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">SELECT</span> id                    <span =
class=3D"hljs-comment">-- =E2=86=90 only the PK, nothing else</span>
    <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">FROM</span> products
    <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">ORDER</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">=
BY</span> price, id
    LIMIT <span class=3D"hljs-number">20</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword=
">OFFSET</span> <span class=3D"hljs-number">450000</span>
) <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">AS</span> page <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">=
USING</span> (id)
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">ORDER</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">BY</=
span> p.price, p.id;          <span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- =E2=86=90 mus=
t repeat! (see gotchas)</span></code></pre></div>
