=3D" alt=3D"N+1 way: one SELECT for 100 authors plus one books query per au=
thor, 1 + 100 =3D 101 queries, each a network round trip" title=3D"N+1 way:=
 one SELECT for 100 authors plus one books query per author, 1 + 100 =3D 10=
