 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z"></path></svg>Note</p><p><strong>Think of it this way:<=
/strong> The full schema is the entire house. A sub-schema is a <strong>win=
dow</strong> =E2=80=94 each user looks through a different window and sees =
only the rooms relevant to them.</p>
