L3RleHQ+CgogIDxwYXRoIGQ9Ik02NjIsMjMzIEg2NzYgVjM5MiBINjYyIiBmaWxsPSJub25lIiB=
zdHJva2U9IiMzZmI5NTAiIHN0cm9rZS13aWR0aD0iMiIvPgogIDx0ZXh0IHg9IjY5MCIgeT0iMj=
