p><strong>Golden rule:</strong> Use <code>CASCADE</code> when the child <st=
rong>cannot exist</strong> without the parent. Use <code>SET NULL</code> wh=
en the child <strong>can exist independently</strong>. Use <code>RESTRICT</=
