strong> It's the rarest type. You use it when:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Security</strong> =E2=80=94 separate sensitive data (e.g., sala=
ry in a different table)</li>
<li><strong>Sparsity</strong> =E2=80=94 only some rows need the extra colum=
ns (avoid NULLs)</li>
<li><strong>Lifecycle</strong> =E2=80=94 entities are created/deleted at di=
fferent times</li>
</ul>
