</section><section class=3D"sec"><h2 id=3D"keys-in-dbms" data-toc=3D"11. Ke=
ys in DBMS"><span class=3D"sec-n">11.</span> Keys in DBMS</h2>
<p>Keys are attributes (or sets of attributes) used to <strong>uniquely ide=
ntify rows</strong>, <strong>establish relationships</strong> between table=
s, and <strong>enforce data integrity</strong>. Understanding keys is funda=
mental =E2=80=94 they drive every table design decision.</p>
