<h3 id=3D"2-candidate-key" data-toc=3D"2. Candidate Key">2. Candidate Key</=
h3>
<p>A <strong>candidate key</strong> is a <strong>minimal super key</strong>=
 =E2=80=94 it uniquely identifies rows, and removing any column from it wou=
ld break uniqueness.</p>
<div class=3D"markdown-alert markdown-alert-note"><p class=3D"markdown-aler=
