 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z"></path></svg>Note</p><p><strong>Think of it as:</stron=
g> &quot;The leanest possible set of columns that still guarantees uniquene=
ss.&quot;</p>
</div>
<h4 id=3D"candidate-keys-for-students">Candidate Keys for <code>students</c=
ode>:</h4>
<div class=3D"tbl"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th style=3D"text-align:center">Candidate Key</th>
