<h3 id=3D"4-alternate-key" data-toc=3D"4. Alternate Key">4. Alternate Key</=
h3>
<p>An <strong>alternate key</strong> is any candidate key that was <strong>=
NOT chosen</strong> as the primary key. They're the &quot;runner-up&quot; i=
dentifiers.</p>
<h4 id=3D"alternate-keys-for-students">Alternate Keys for <code>students</c=
ode>:</h4>
<div class=3D"tbl"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th style=3D"text-align:center">Key</th>
<th>Role</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style=3D"text-align:center"><code>{roll_no}</code></td>
<td><strong>Primary Key</strong> (chosen)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style=3D"text-align:center"><code>{email}</code></td>
<td><strong>Alternate Key</strong> (not chosen as PK, but still unique)</td=
>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style=3D"text-align:center"><code>{phone}</code></td>
<td><strong>Alternate Key</strong> (not chosen as PK, but still unique)</td=
>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
