<h3 id=3D"5-foreign-key" data-toc=3D"5. Foreign Key">5. Foreign Key</h3>
<p>A <strong>foreign key</strong> is a column (or set of columns) in one ta=
ble that <strong>references the primary key of another table</strong>. It c=
reates a link between two tables.</p>
