</section><section class=3D"sec"><h2 id=3D"sql-joins-inner-left-right-full-=
cross-self--natural" data-toc=3D"12. SQL Joins (INNER, LEFT, RIGHT, FULL, C=
ROSS, =E2=80=A6"><span class=3D"sec-n">12.</span> SQL Joins (INNER, LEFT, R=
IGHT, FULL, CROSS, SELF &amp; NATURAL)</h2>
<p>SQL Joins combine rows from two or more tables based on a related column=
. Without joins, your data would be trapped in isolated tables =E2=80=94 jo=
ins are how you <strong>reconnect</strong> it.</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"sample-data-used-throughout" data-toc=3D"Sample Data (Used Throug=
hout)">Sample Data (Used Throughout)</h3>
<h4 id=3D"student-table"><code>Student</code> Table</h4>
<div class=3D"tbl"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th style=3D"text-align:center">ROLL_NO</th>
<th style=3D"text-align:center">NAME</th>
<th style=3D"text-align:center">AGE</th>
<th style=3D"text-align:center">DEPT</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">1</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">Alice</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">20</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">CSE</td>
</tr>
