<h3 id=3D"1-inner-join" data-toc=3D"1. INNER JOIN">1. INNER JOIN</h3>
<p>Returns <strong>only rows that have matching values in both tables</stro=
ng>. Non-matching rows from both sides are excluded.</p>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">SQL</span></div><pre><code class=3D"=
hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">SELECT</span> Student.NAME, Student.AGE,=
 StudentCourse.COURSE_ID
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">FROM</span> Student
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">INNER</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">JOIN=
</span> StudentCourse
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">ON</span> Student.ROLL_NO <span class=3D"hljs-=
operator">=3D</span> StudentCourse.ROLL_NO;</code></pre></div>
