<h3 id=3D"2-left-join-left-outer-join" data-toc=3D"2. LEFT JOIN (LEFT OUTER=
 JOIN)">2. LEFT JOIN (LEFT OUTER JOIN)</h3>
<p>Returns <strong>all rows from the left table</strong>, plus matching row=
s from the right table. If no match exists, the right-side columns show <st=
rong>NULL</strong>.</p>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">SQL</span></div><pre><code class=3D"=
hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">SELECT</span> Student.NAME, StudentCours=
e.COURSE_ID
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">FROM</span> Student
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">LEFT</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">JOIN<=
/span> StudentCourse
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">ON</span> Student.ROLL_NO <span class=3D"hljs-=
operator">=3D</span> StudentCourse.ROLL_NO;</code></pre></div>
