<h3 id=3D"5-cross-join-cartesian-product" data-toc=3D"5. CROSS JOIN (Cartes=
ian Product)">5. CROSS JOIN (Cartesian Product)</h3>
<p>Returns <strong>every possible combination</strong> of rows from both ta=
bles. No <code>ON</code> condition needed.</p>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">SQL</span></div><pre><code class=3D"=
hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">SELECT</span> Student.NAME, StudentCours=
e.COURSE_ID
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">FROM</span> Student
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">CROSS</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">JOIN=
