<h3 id=3D"6-self-join" data-toc=3D"6. SELF JOIN">6. SELF JOIN</h3>
<p>A table is joined <strong>with itself</strong>. Used when rows in a tabl=
e have a relationship with other rows in the <strong>same table</strong>.</=
p>
<h4 id=3D"example--employee--manager">Example =E2=80=94 Employee &amp; Mana=
ger</h4>
<div class=3D"tbl"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th style=3D"text-align:center">emp_id</th>
<th style=3D"text-align:center">name</th>
<th style=3D"text-align:center">manager_id</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">1</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">Alice</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">NULL</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">2</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">Bob</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">1</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">3</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">Carol</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">1</td>
