<h3 id=3D"7-natural-join" data-toc=3D"7. NATURAL JOIN">7. NATURAL JOIN</h3>
<p>Automatically joins tables on <strong>all columns with the same name and=
 data type</strong>. No <code>ON</code> clause needed =E2=80=94 it figures =
out the join column itself.</p>
<h4 id=3D"example-1">Example</h4>
<p><strong><code>Employee</code> Table:</strong></p>
<div class=3D"tbl"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th style=3D"text-align:center">emp_id</th>
<th style=3D"text-align:center">emp_name</th>
<th style=3D"text-align:center">dept_id</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">1</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">Alice</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">10</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">2</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">Bob</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">20</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">3</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">Carol</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">10</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
<p><strong><code>Department</code> Table:</strong></p>
<div class=3D"tbl"><table>
<thead>
