<h4 id=3D"why-use-views">Why Use Views?</h4>
<div class=3D"tbl"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Benefit</th>
<th>Explanation</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><strong>Simplify complex queries</strong></td>
<td>Wrap a 20-line JOIN query into <code>SELECT * FROM MyView</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Security</strong></td>
<td>Expose only certain columns/rows to specific users (hide salary, SSN, e=
tc.)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Abstraction</strong></td>
<td>If table structure changes, update the view =E2=80=94 applications don'=
t need to change</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Reusability</strong></td>
<td>Write the logic once, use it everywhere</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
<hr>
