</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">SQL</span></div><pre><code class=3D"=
hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">CREATE</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keywor=
d">VIEW</span> view_name <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">AS</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">SELECT</span> column1, column2, ...
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">FROM</span> table_name
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">WHERE</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">cond=
ition</span>;</code></pre></div>
<h4 id=3D"example-1--view-from-a-single-table">Example 1 =E2=80=94 View fro=
m a Single Table</h4>
<p>Create a view that shows only students with <code>S_ID &lt; 5</code>:</p=
>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
