<h3 id=3D"3-modifying-data-through-views" data-toc=3D"3. Modifying Data Thr=
ough Views">3. Modifying Data Through Views</h3>
<h4 id=3D"insert-through-a-view">INSERT Through a View</h4>
<p>You can insert data through a view =E2=80=94 it actually inserts into th=
e underlying table:</p>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">SQL</span></div><pre><code class=3D"=
hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">INSERT</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keywor=
d">INTO</span> DetailsView (NAME, ADDRESS)
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">VALUES</span> (<span class=3D"hljs-string">&#x=
27;John&#x27;</span>, <span class=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;Berlin&#x27;</span>=
);</code></pre></div>
<p>The row is inserted into <code>StudentDetails</code>. When you query the=
 view, it appears.</p>
<h4 id=3D"update-through-a-view">UPDATE Through a View</h4>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">SQL</span></div><pre><code class=3D"=
hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">UPDATE</span> DetailsView
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">SET</span> ADDRESS <span class=3D"hljs-operato=
r">=3D</span> <span class=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;Bangalore&#x27;</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">WHERE</span> NAME <span class=3D"hljs-operator=
">=3D</span> <span class=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;Alice&#x27;</span>;</code></=
pre></div>
<p>This updates the <code>ADDRESS</code> in the underlying <code>StudentDet=
ails</code> table.</p>
<h4 id=3D"delete-through-a-view">DELETE Through a View</h4>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">SQL</span></div><pre><code class=3D"=
hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">DELETE</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keywor=
d">FROM</span> DetailsView
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">WHERE</span> NAME <span class=3D"hljs-operator=
">=3D</span> <span class=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;John&#x27;</span>;</code></p=
re></div>
<p>The row is removed from the underlying <code>StudentDetails</code> table=
.</p>
