<h3 id=3D"4-rules-for-updatable-views" data-toc=3D"4. Rules for Updatable V=
iews">4. Rules for Updatable Views</h3>
<div class=3D"markdown-alert markdown-alert-warning"><p class=3D"markdown-a=
lert-title"><svg class=3D"octicon octicon-alert mr-2" viewBox=3D"0 0 16 16"=
 version=3D"1.1" width=3D"16" height=3D"16" aria-hidden=3D"true"><path d=3D=
"M6.457 1.047c.659-1.234 2.427-1.234 3.086 0l6.082 11.378A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 1=
4.082 15H1.918a1.75 1.75 0 0 1-1.543-2.575Zm1.763.707a.25.25 0 0 0-.44 0L1.=
698 13.132a.25.25 0 0 0 .22.368h12.164a.25.25 0 0 0 .22-.368Zm.53 3.996v2.5=
a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-2.5a.75.75 0 0 1 1.5 0ZM9 11a1 1 0 1 1-2 0 1 1 0 0 1 2=
 0Z"></path></svg>Warning</p><p><strong>Not all views are updatable.</stron=
g> A view can be updated (INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE) only if it meets ALL of the=
se conditions:</p>
</div>
<div class=3D"tbl"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Rule</th>
<th>Why</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>No <code>GROUP BY</code> clause</td>
<td>Aggregated rows can't map back to individual rows</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>No <code>HAVING</code> clause</td>
<td>Same reason =E2=80=94 it's tied to grouping</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>No <code>DISTINCT</code> keyword</td>
<td>Can't determine which duplicate row to update</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>No aggregate functions (<code>SUM</code>, <code>COUNT</code>, etc.)</td=
>
<td>Computed values can't be &quot;un-computed&quot;</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Created from a <strong>single table</strong></td>
<td>Multi-table views have ambiguous update targets</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>All <code>NOT NULL</code> columns must be included</td>
<td>Otherwise INSERT would fail on the base table</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>No subqueries in <code>SELECT</code></td>
<td>Complex derived values can't be reversed</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
