<h3 id=3D"5-with-check-option" data-toc=3D"5. WITH CHECK OPTION">5. WITH CH=
ECK OPTION</h3>
<p>The <code>WITH CHECK OPTION</code> clause ensures that any <code>INSERT<=
/code> or <code>UPDATE</code> through the view <strong>must satisfy the vie=
w's WHERE condition</strong>. If the new/updated row would fall outside the=
 view's filter, the operation is <strong>rejected</strong>.</p>
<h4 id=3D"example-2">Example</h4>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">SQL</span></div><pre><code class=3D"=
hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">CREATE</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keywor=
d">VIEW</span> CSE_Students <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">AS</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">SELECT</span> S_ID, NAME, ADDRESS
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">FROM</span> StudentDetails
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">WHERE</span> ADDRESS <span class=3D"hljs-opera=
tor">=3D</span> <span class=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;Delhi&#x27;</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">WITH</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">CHECK=
</span> OPTION;</code></pre></div>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">SQL</span></div><pre><code class=3D"=
hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- =E2=9C=85 This works =E2=80=94 ADDRES=
S is &#x27;Delhi&#x27;, satisfies the WHERE</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">INSERT</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">INT=
O</span> CSE_Students (S_ID, NAME, ADDRESS)
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">VALUES</span> (<span class=3D"hljs-number">6</=
span>, <span class=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;Frank&#x27;</span>, <span class=3D=
"hljs-string">&#x27;Delhi&#x27;</span>);

<span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- =E2=9D=8C This FAILS =E2=80=94 ADDRESS is &=
#x27;Mumbai&#x27;, violates the WHERE</span>
