<h3 id=3D"6-views-vs-tables--quick-comparison" data-toc=3D"6. Views vs Tabl=
es =E2=80=94 Quick Comparison">6. Views vs Tables =E2=80=94 Quick Compariso=
n</h3>
<div class=3D"tbl"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Aspect</th>
<th>Table</th>
<th>View</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><strong>Stores data?</strong></td>
<td>=E2=9C=85 Yes, physically on disk</td>
<td>=E2=9D=8C No, just a saved query</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Takes storage space?</strong></td>
<td>=E2=9C=85 Yes</td>
<td>=E2=9D=8C No (only the query definition)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Can be indexed?</strong></td>
<td>=E2=9C=85 Yes</td>
<td>=E2=9D=8C Not usually (some RDBMS support materialized views)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Auto-updates when base data changes?</strong></td>
<td>N/A</td>
<td>=E2=9C=85 Yes (always shows fresh data)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Can INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE?</strong></td>
<td>=E2=9C=85 Always</td>
<td>=E2=9A=A0=EF=B8=8F Only if updatable (see rules above)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Performance</strong></td>
<td>Direct access</td>
<td>May be slower (runs underlying query each time)</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
<h4 id=3D"materialized-views-bonus">Materialized Views (Bonus)</h4>
<p>Some databases (PostgreSQL, Oracle) support <strong>materialized views</=
strong> =E2=80=94 these actually <strong>store the query result</strong> ph=
ysically and need to be <strong>refreshed</strong> periodically:</p>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">SQL</span></div><pre><code class=3D"=
hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- PostgreSQL</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">CREATE</span> MATERIALIZED <span class=3D"hljs=
-keyword">VIEW</span> MatView <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">AS</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">SELECT</span> dept, <span class=3D"hljs-built_=
in">COUNT</span>(<span class=3D"hljs-operator">*</span>) <span class=3D"hlj=
s-keyword">AS</span> emp_count
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">FROM</span> employees
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">GROUP</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">BY</=
span> dept;

<span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- Refresh when needed</span>
REFRESH MATERIALIZED <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">VIEW</span> MatView;</cod=
e></pre></div>
<div class=3D"tbl"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th></th>
<th>Regular View</th>
<th>Materialized View</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Stores data?</td>
<td>=E2=9D=8C No</td>
<td>=E2=9C=85 Yes</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Always up-to-date?</td>
<td>=E2=9C=85 Yes</td>
<td>=E2=9D=8C No (must refresh)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Fast to query?</td>
<td>=E2=9D=8C Runs query each time</td>
<td>=E2=9C=85 Pre-computed</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Use case</td>
<td>Real-time data</td>
<td>Analytics, dashboards, expensive queries</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
