<h4 id=3D"1-ddl-triggers">1. DDL Triggers</h4>
<p>Fire on <strong>structure changes</strong> =E2=80=94 <code>CREATE</code>=
, <code>ALTER</code>, <code>DROP</code>.</p>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">SQL</span></div><pre><code class=3D"=
hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- Prevent anyone from dropping tables</=
span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">CREATE</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">TRI=
GGER</span> prevent_table_drop
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">ON</span> DATABASE
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">FOR</span> CREATE_TABLE, ALTER_TABLE, DROP_TAB=
LE
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">AS</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">BEGIN</span>
    PRINT <span class=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;You cannot create, alter or dro=
p tables in this database!&#x27;</span>;
    <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">ROLLBACK</span>;
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">END</span>;</code></pre></div>
<div class=3D"markdown-alert markdown-alert-note"><p class=3D"markdown-aler=
t-title"><svg class=3D"octicon octicon-info mr-2" viewBox=3D"0 0 16 16" ver=
sion=3D"1.1" width=3D"16" height=3D"16" aria-hidden=3D"true"><path d=3D"M0 =
8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 0 1 0 8Zm8-6.5a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 0 13 6.5 6.5 0 0 0 0-13=
ZM6.5 7.75A.75.75 0 0 1 7.25 7h1a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.75h.25a.75.75 0 0 1 =
0 1.5h-2a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h.25v-2h-.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75ZM8 6a1 1 0 1 1=
 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z"></path></svg>Note</p><p>Useful for protecting producti=
on databases from accidental schema changes.</p>
</div>
<h4 id=3D"2-dml-triggers">2. DML Triggers</h4>
<p>Fire on <strong>data changes</strong> =E2=80=94 <code>INSERT</code>, <co=
de>UPDATE</code>, <code>DELETE</code>. Most common type.</p>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">SQL</span></div><pre><code class=3D"=
hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- Prevent all modifications to a sensit=
ive table</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">CREATE</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">TRI=
GGER</span> prevent_update
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">ON</span> students
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">FOR</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">UPDATE=
</span>, <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">INSERT</span>, <span class=3D"hljs-ke=
yword">DELETE</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">AS</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">BEGIN</span>
    RAISERROR(<span class=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;You cannot modify rows in t=
his table.&#x27;</span>, <span class=3D"hljs-number">16</span>, <span class=
=3D"hljs-number">1</span>);
    <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">ROLLBACK</span> TRANSACTION;
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">END</span>;</code></pre></div>
<h4 id=3D"3-logon-triggers">3. Logon Triggers</h4>
<p>Fire when a <strong>user logs in</strong>. Used for tracking logins, lim=
iting sessions, or blocking access.</p>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">SQL</span></div><pre><code class=3D"=
hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">CREATE</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keywor=
d">TRIGGER</span> track_logon
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">ON</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">ALL</sp=
an> SERVER
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">FOR</span> LOGON
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">AS</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">BEGIN</span>
    PRINT <span class=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;A new user has logged in.&#x27;=
</span>;
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">END</span>;</code></pre></div>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"real-world-examples-1" data-toc=3D"Real-World Examples">Real-Worl=
d Examples</h3>
<h4 id=3D"example-1--auto-update-timestamp">Example 1 =E2=80=94 Auto-Update=
 Timestamp</h4>
<p>Automatically set <code>updated_at</code> whenever a user record is modi=
fied:</p>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">SQL</span></div><pre><code class=3D"=
hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">CREATE</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keywor=
d">TABLE</span> users (
    id         <span class=3D"hljs-type">INT</span> <span class=3D"hljs-key=
word">PRIMARY</span> KEY,
    name       <span class=3D"hljs-type">VARCHAR</span>(<span class=3D"hljs=
-number">50</span>),
    email      <span class=3D"hljs-type">VARCHAR</span>(<span class=3D"hljs=
-number">100</span>),
    updated_at <span class=3D"hljs-type">TIMESTAMP</span>
);

<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">CREATE</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">TRI=
GGER</span> update_timestamp
BEFORE <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">UPDATE</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keywo=
rd">ON</span> users
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">FOR</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">EACH</=
span> <span class=3D"hljs-type">ROW</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">BEGIN</span>
    <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">SET</span> NEW.updated_at <span class=3D"h=
ljs-operator">=3D</span> <span class=3D"hljs-built_in">CURRENT_TIMESTAMP</s=
pan>;
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">END</span>;</code></pre></div>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">SQL</span></div><pre><code class=3D"=
hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">INSERT</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keywor=
d">INTO</span> users (id, name, email) <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">VALUES<=
/span> (<span class=3D"hljs-number">1</span>, <span class=3D"hljs-string">&=
#x27;Amit&#x27;</span>, <span class=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;amit@example.com&=
#x27;</span>);
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">UPDATE</span> users <span class=3D"hljs-keywor=
d">SET</span> email <span class=3D"hljs-operator">=3D</span> <span class=3D=
"hljs-string">&#x27;amit_new@example.com&#x27;</span> <span class=3D"hljs-k=
eyword">WHERE</span> id <span class=3D"hljs-operator">=3D</span> <span clas=
s=3D"hljs-number">1</span>;</code></pre></div>
<p><strong>Result:</strong> <code>updated_at</code> is automatically set =
=E2=80=94 no manual intervention needed.</p>
