<h4 id=3D"example-2--data-validation">Example 2 =E2=80=94 Data Validation</=
h4>
<p>Reject grades outside the valid range:</p>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">SQL</span></div><pre><code class=3D"=
hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">CREATE</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keywor=
d">TRIGGER</span> validate_grade
BEFORE <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">INSERT</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keywo=
rd">ON</span> student_grades
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">FOR</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">EACH</=
span> <span class=3D"hljs-type">ROW</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">BEGIN</span>
    IF NEW.grade <span class=3D"hljs-operator">&lt;</span> <span class=3D"h=
ljs-number">0</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">OR</span> NEW.grade <span=
 class=3D"hljs-operator">&gt;</span> <span class=3D"hljs-number">100</span>=
 <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">THEN</span>
        SIGNAL <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">SQLSTATE</span> <span class=3D"=
hljs-string">&#x27;45000&#x27;</span>
        <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">SET</span> MESSAGE_TEXT <span class=3D=
"hljs-operator">=3D</span> <span class=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;Invalid grade!=
 Must be between 0 and 100.&#x27;</span>;
    <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">END</span> IF;
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">END</span>;</code></pre></div>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">SQL</span></div><pre><code class=3D"=
hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">INSERT</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keywor=
d">INTO</span> student_grades <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">VALUES</span> (<=
span class=3D"hljs-number">1</span>, <span class=3D"hljs-number">85</span>)=
;   <span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- =E2=9C=85 Works</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">INSERT</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">INT=
O</span> student_grades <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">VALUES</span> (<span c=
lass=3D"hljs-number">2</span>, <span class=3D"hljs-number">150</span>);  <s=
pan class=3D"hljs-comment">-- =E2=9D=8C Rejected: &quot;Invalid grade!&quot=
;</span></code></pre></div>
<h4 id=3D"example-3--auto-calculate-totals-after-insert">Example 3 =E2=80=
=94 Auto-Calculate Totals (AFTER INSERT)</h4>
<p>Automatically compute total marks and percentage when student marks are =
inserted:</p>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">SQL</span></div><pre><code class=3D"=
hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">CREATE</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keywor=
d">TRIGGER</span> stud_marks
AFTER <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">INSERT</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keywor=
d">ON</span> Student
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">FOR</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">EACH</=
span> <span class=3D"hljs-type">ROW</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">BEGIN</span>
    <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">UPDATE</span> Student
    <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">SET</span>
        total <span class=3D"hljs-operator">=3D</span> NEW.subj1 <span clas=
s=3D"hljs-operator">+</span> NEW.subj2 <span class=3D"hljs-operator">+</spa=
n> NEW.subj3,
        <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">per</span> <span class=3D"hljs-operato=
r">=3D</span> (NEW.subj1 <span class=3D"hljs-operator">+</span> NEW.subj2 <=
span class=3D"hljs-operator">+</span> NEW.subj3) <span class=3D"hljs-operat=
or">/</span> <span class=3D"hljs-number">3.0</span>
    <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">WHERE</span> tid <span class=3D"hljs-opera=
tor">=3D</span> NEW.tid;
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">END</span>;</code></pre></div>
<h4 id=3D"example-4--audit-log">Example 4 =E2=80=94 Audit Log</h4>
<p>Track every change to the <code>employees</code> table:</p>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">SQL</span></div><pre><code class=3D"=
hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">CREATE</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keywor=
d">TABLE</span> employee_audit (
    audit_id    <span class=3D"hljs-type">INT</span> AUTO_INCREMENT <span c=
lass=3D"hljs-keyword">PRIMARY</span> KEY,
    emp_id      <span class=3D"hljs-type">INT</span>,
    action      <span class=3D"hljs-type">VARCHAR</span>(<span class=3D"hlj=
s-number">10</span>),
    old_salary  <span class=3D"hljs-type">DECIMAL</span>(<span class=3D"hlj=
s-number">10</span>,<span class=3D"hljs-number">2</span>),
    new_salary  <span class=3D"hljs-type">DECIMAL</span>(<span class=3D"hlj=
s-number">10</span>,<span class=3D"hljs-number">2</span>),
    changed_at  <span class=3D"hljs-type">TIMESTAMP</span> <span class=3D"h=
ljs-keyword">DEFAULT</span> <span class=3D"hljs-built_in">CURRENT_TIMESTAMP=
</span>
);

<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">CREATE</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">TRI=
GGER</span> log_salary_change
AFTER <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">UPDATE</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keywor=
d">ON</span> employees
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">FOR</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">EACH</=
span> <span class=3D"hljs-type">ROW</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">BEGIN</span>
    IF OLD.salary <span class=3D"hljs-operator">&lt;&gt;</span> NEW.salary =
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">THEN</span>
        <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">INSERT</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyw=
ord">INTO</span> employee_audit (emp_id, action, old_salary, new_salary)
        <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">VALUES</span> (NEW.emp_id, <span class=
=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;UPDATE&#x27;</span>, OLD.salary, NEW.salary);
    <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">END</span> IF;
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">END</span>;</code></pre></div>
