0 1.5h-2a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h.25v-2h-.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75ZM8 6a1 1 0 1 1=
 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z"></path></svg>Note</p><p>Even <em>with</em> migration t=
ooling, a DBA hotfixing a procedure directly in prod at 2 AM instantly desy=
ncs the database from Git =E2=80=94 and nobody finds out until something br=
eaks.</p>
