<tr>
<th style=3D"text-align:center">emp_id (PK)</th>
<th style=3D"text-align:center">email (UQ)</th>
<th style=3D"text-align:center">phone (UQ)</th>
<th style=3D"text-align:center">aadhar_no (UQ)</th>
<th style=3D"text-align:center">name</th>
<th style=3D"text-align:center">dept</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">1</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center"><a href=3D"mailto:alice@co.com">alice@co.co=
m</a></td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">9876543210</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">1234-5678-9012</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">Alice</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">CSE</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">2</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center"><a href=3D"mailto:bob@co.com">bob@co.com</a=
></td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">9876543211</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">2345-6789-0123</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">Bob</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">ECE</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">3</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center"><a href=3D"mailto:carol@co.com">carol@co.co=
m</a></td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">NULL</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">NULL</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">Carol</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">CSE</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
<p><strong>What's allowed and what's not (MySQL):</strong></p>
<div class=3D"tbl"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Operation</th>
<th style=3D"text-align:center">Allowed?</th>
<th>Why</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>INSERT (emp_id=3DNULL, ...)</code></td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9D=8C</td>
<td>PK cannot be NULL</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>INSERT (emp_id=3D1, ...)</code></td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9D=8C</td>
<td>PK must be unique (1 already exists)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>INSERT (emp_id=3D4, email=3DNULL, ...)</code></td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9C=85</td>
<td>Unique key allows NULL</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>INSERT (emp_id=3D5, email=3D'alice@co.com', ...)</code></td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9D=8C</td>
<td>Unique key violation (email already exists)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>INSERT (emp_id=3D6, phone=3DNULL, ...)</code></td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9C=85</td>
<td>Carol's phone is already NULL, but MySQL allows multiple NULLs in a UNI=
QUE column (SQL Server would reject this)</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
