<h3 id=3D"when-to-use-which-1" data-toc=3D"When to Use Which?">When to Use =
Which?</h3>
<div class=3D"tbl"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Scenario</th>
<th>Use</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Main row identifier (emp_id, roll_no)</td>
<td><strong>Primary Key</strong></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Must be unique but not the main ID (email, phone, SSN)</td>
<td><strong>Unique Key</strong></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Column may have NULL values but still needs uniqueness</td>
<td><strong>Unique Key</strong></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Referenced by foreign keys in other tables</td>
<td><strong>Primary Key</strong> (preferred) or Unique Key</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
