ike UUID v4" loading=3D"lazy"></p>
<p>Because the timestamp occupies the most significant bits, UUID v7 values=
 generated <strong>later</strong> are always <strong>greater</strong> than =
earlier ones =E2=80=94 they're <strong>roughly sequential</strong>, just li=
ke auto-increment IDs. This means:</p>
<ul>
<li>Inserts go to the <strong>end</strong> of the B+ Tree (no random page s=
plits)</li>
<li>Page utilization stays high (~85-90%)</li>
<li>Performance is close to auto-increment</li>
</ul>
