<h4 id=3D"the-vulnerable-code">The Vulnerable Code</h4>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">text</span></div><pre><code class=3D=
"hljs">txtUserId =3D getRequestString(&quot;UserId&quot;);           // Use=
r input
txtSQL =3D &quot;SELECT * FROM Users WHERE UserId =3D &quot; + txtUserId;  =
 // String concatenation</code></pre></div>
<p>The problem: <strong>user input is directly concatenated</strong> into t=
he SQL query without any validation.</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"types-of-sql-injection-attacks" data-toc=3D"Types of SQL Injectio=
n Attacks">Types of SQL Injection Attacks</h3>
<h4 id=3D"1-tautology-attack-11-is-always-true">1. Tautology Attack (1=3D1 =
is Always True)</h4>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">text</span></div><pre><code class=3D=
"hljs">  Input:  105 OR 1=3D1
  Query:  SELECT * FROM Users WHERE UserId =3D 105 OR 1=3D1;</code></pre></=
div>
