<h4 id=3D"3-batched-statements-destructive">3. Batched Statements (Destruct=
ive)</h4>
<p>User input: <code>105; DROP TABLE Suppliers</code></p>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">SQL</span></div><pre><code class=3D"=
hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">SELECT</span> <span class=3D"hljs-operat=
or">*</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">FROM</span> Users <span class=3D"=
hljs-keyword">WHERE</span> UserId <span class=3D"hljs-operator">=3D</span> =
<span class=3D"hljs-number">105</span>; <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">DROP</=
span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">TABLE</span> Suppliers;</code></pre></di=
v>
<p>This executes TWO statements:</p>
<ol>
<li>Returns user 105 (harmless)</li>
<li><strong>Deletes the entire Suppliers table</strong> (catastrophic!)</li=
>
</ol>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">text</span></div><pre><code class=3D=
"hljs">  Step 1: SELECT * FROM Users WHERE UserId =3D 105  =E2=9C=85 Normal=
 query
  Step 2: DROP TABLE Suppliers                     =F0=9F=92=80 TABLE DESTR=
OYED!</code></pre></div>
<h4 id=3D"4-union-based-injection">4. UNION-Based Injection</h4>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">SQL</span></div><pre><code class=3D"=
hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- Normal query</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">SELECT</span> name, email <span class=3D"hljs-=
keyword">FROM</span> Users <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">WHERE</span> id <sp=
an class=3D"hljs-operator">=3D</span> <span class=3D"hljs-number">1</span>

<span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- Injected: 1 UNION SELECT username, password=
 FROM admin_users</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">SELECT</span> name, email <span class=3D"hljs-=
keyword">FROM</span> Users <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">WHERE</span> id <sp=
an class=3D"hljs-operator">=3D</span> <span class=3D"hljs-number">1</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">UNION</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">SELE=
CT</span> username, password <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">FROM</span> admin=
_users</code></pre></div>
<p>The attacker <strong>piggybacks a second query</strong> to extract data =
from a completely different table.</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"prevention--parameterized-queries" data-toc=3D"Prevention =E2=80=
=94 Parameterized Queries">Prevention =E2=80=94 Parameterized Queries</h3>
