</section><section class=3D"sec"><h2 id=3D"mysql-grant--revoke-privileges-d=
etailed" data-toc=3D"19. MySQL GRANT / REVOKE Privileges (Detailed)"><span =
class=3D"sec-n">19.</span> MySQL GRANT / REVOKE Privileges (Detailed)</h2>
<p>The <a href=3D"#4-dcl--data-control-language">DCL overview</a> introduce=
d <code>GRANT</code> and <code>REVOKE</code>. This is the full reference: t=
he <strong>MySQL-specific syntax</strong>, privilege types, granting on fun=
ctions/procedures, checking grants, delegation with <code>GRANT OPTION</cod=
e> / <code>CASCADE</code>, and privilege scopes.</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"grant--assigning-privileges" data-toc=3D"GRANT =E2=80=94 Assignin=
g Privileges">GRANT =E2=80=94 Assigning Privileges</h3>
<h4 id=3D"syntax-2">Syntax</h4>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">SQL</span></div><pre><code class=3D"=
hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">GRANT</span> privilege_type <span class=
=3D"hljs-keyword">ON</span> object <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">TO</span> <=
span class=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;user&#x27;</span>@<span class=3D"hljs-stri=
ng">&#x27;host&#x27;</span>;</code></pre></div>
<div class=3D"markdown-alert markdown-alert-note"><p class=3D"markdown-aler=
t-title"><svg class=3D"octicon octicon-info mr-2" viewBox=3D"0 0 16 16" ver=
sion=3D"1.1" width=3D"16" height=3D"16" aria-hidden=3D"true"><path d=3D"M0 =
8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 0 1 0 8Zm8-6.5a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 0 13 6.5 6.5 0 0 0 0-13=
ZM6.5 7.75A.75.75 0 0 1 7.25 7h1a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.75h.25a.75.75 0 0 1 =
0 1.5h-2a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h.25v-2h-.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75ZM8 6a1 1 0 1 1=
 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z"></path></svg>Note</p><p><strong>User format:</strong> =
Always specify as <code>'username'@'host'</code> =E2=80=94 e.g., <code>'Ami=
t'@'localhost'</code> or <code>'Amit'@'192.168.1.100'</code>.</p>
</div>
<h4 id=3D"common-privilege-types">Common Privilege Types</h4>
<div class=3D"tbl"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Privilege</th>
<th>What It Allows</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>SELECT</code></td>
<td>Read data from tables</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>INSERT</code></td>
<td>Add new rows</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>UPDATE</code></td>
<td>Modify existing rows</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>DELETE</code></td>
<td>Remove rows</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>CREATE</code></td>
<td>Create new tables/databases</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>DROP</code></td>
<td>Delete tables/databases</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>ALTER</code></td>
<td>Modify table structure</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>INDEX</code></td>
<td>Create/drop indexes</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>EXECUTE</code></td>
<td>Run stored procedures/functions</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>GRANT OPTION</code></td>
<td>Pass privileges to other users</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>ALL PRIVILEGES</code> (or just <code>ALL</code>)</td>
<td>Everything above</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
<h4 id=3D"examples-1">Examples</h4>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">SQL</span></div><pre><code class=3D"=
hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- 1. Grant SELECT only (read-only acces=
s)</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">GRANT</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">SELE=
CT</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">ON</span> Users <span class=3D"hljs-=
keyword">TO</span> <span class=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;Amit&#x27;</span>@<spa=
n class=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;localhost&#x27;</span>;

<span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- 2. Grant multiple privileges (read + write =
access)</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">GRANT</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">SELE=
CT</span>, <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">INSERT</span>, <span class=3D"hljs-=
keyword">UPDATE</span>, <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">DELETE</span> <span cl=
ass=3D"hljs-keyword">ON</span> Users <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">TO</span>=
 <span class=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;Amit&#x27;</span>@<span class=3D"hljs-st=
ring">&#x27;localhost&#x27;</span>;

<span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- 3. Grant ALL privileges on a table</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">GRANT</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">ALL<=
/span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">ON</span> Users <span class=3D"hljs-key=
word">TO</span> <span class=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;Amit&#x27;</span>@<span c=
lass=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;localhost&#x27;</span>;

<span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- 4. NOT &quot;all users&quot; =E2=80=94 this=
 names a literal user called &#x27;*&#x27; (see warning below)</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">GRANT</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">SELE=
CT</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">ON</span> Users <span class=3D"hljs-=
keyword">TO</span> <span class=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;*&#x27;</span>@<span c=
lass=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;localhost&#x27;</span>;

<span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- 5. Grant on entire database</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">GRANT</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">ALL<=
/span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">ON</span> my_database.<span class=3D"hl=
js-operator">*</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">TO</span> <span class=3D=
"hljs-string">&#x27;Amit&#x27;</span>@<span class=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;loc=
alhost&#x27;</span>;

<span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- 6. Grant on all databases</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">GRANT</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">ALL<=
/span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">ON</span> <span class=3D"hljs-operator"=
>*</span>.<span class=3D"hljs-operator">*</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keywor=
d">TO</span> <span class=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;Amit&#x27;</span>@<span clas=
s=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;localhost&#x27;</span>;</code></pre></div>
<div class=3D"markdown-alert markdown-alert-warning"><p class=3D"markdown-a=
lert-title"><svg class=3D"octicon octicon-alert mr-2" viewBox=3D"0 0 16 16"=
 version=3D"1.1" width=3D"16" height=3D"16" aria-hidden=3D"true"><path d=3D=
"M6.457 1.047c.659-1.234 2.427-1.234 3.086 0l6.082 11.378A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 1=
4.082 15H1.918a1.75 1.75 0 0 1-1.543-2.575Zm1.763.707a.25.25 0 0 0-.44 0L1.=
