<h3 id=3D"grant-option--cascade" data-toc=3D"GRANT OPTION &amp; CASCADE">GR=
ANT OPTION &amp; CASCADE</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong><code>WITH GRANT OPTION</code></strong> =E2=80=94 allows the gr=
antee to further grant the same privilege to other users (delegation).</li>
<li><strong><code>CASCADE</code></strong> =E2=80=94 when revoking, also rev=
okes from anyone who received the privilege through the original grantee.</=
li>
</ul>
