ey index (data can only be physically sorted one way)</li>
<li>The leaf nodes store the <strong>complete row data</strong> (all column=
s)</li>
<li>Data is <strong>physically sorted</strong> by the primary key on disk</=
li>
<li>Lookups by primary key reach the data directly =E2=80=94 <strong>one B+=
 Tree traversal</strong></li>
