<h3 id=3D"impact-on-write-performance" data-toc=3D"Impact on Write Performa=
nce">Impact on Write Performance</h3>
<h4 id=3D"-the-core-rule">=E2=AD=90 The Core Rule</h4>
<p><strong>Every index is a separate B+ Tree that must be maintained on eve=
ry write.</strong></p>
<p>One <code>INSERT</code> into a table with 4 secondary indexes is really =
<strong>5 B+ Tree insertions</strong> =E2=80=94 one clustered, four seconda=
ry. Each lands in a <em>different</em> tree, at a <em>different</em> place =
on disk.</p>
