<h5 id=3D"-the-rule--only-the-primary-key-has-to-be-sequential">=E2=AD=90 T=
he Rule =E2=80=94 Only the Primary Key Has to Be Sequential</h5>
<div class=3D"markdown-alert markdown-alert-caution"><p class=3D"markdown-a=
