<h3 id=3D"when-do-you-need-cursors" data-toc=3D"When Do You Need Cursors?">=
When Do You Need Cursors?</h3>
<div class=3D"tbl"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Use Case</th>
<th>Why a Cursor Helps</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Row-by-row processing</td>
<td>Need to apply different logic per row</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Complex calculations</td>
<td>Result of one row depends on previous rows</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Calling procedures per row</td>
<td>Need to call a stored procedure for each record</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Generating sequential reports</td>
<td>Row-by-row output with running totals</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
