 0Z"></path></svg>Warning</p><p><strong>Important:</strong> Cursors are <st=
rong>slower</strong> than set-based operations. SQL is designed to work on =
sets of rows, not one at a time. <strong>Always prefer set-based queries</s=
trong> (<code>UPDATE ... WHERE</code>, <code>INSERT ... SELECT</code>) when=
 possible. Use cursors only as a last resort.</p>
</div>
