<h3 id=3D"mysql-cursor-example-inside-a-stored-procedure" data-toc=3D"MySQL=
 Cursor Example (Inside a Stored Procedure)">MySQL Cursor Example (Inside a=
 Stored Procedure)</h3>
<p>In MySQL, cursors can only be used inside <strong>stored procedures or f=
unctions</strong>:</p>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">SQL</span></div><pre><code class=3D"=
hljs">DELIMITER <span class=3D"hljs-operator">/</span><span class=3D"hljs-o=
perator">/</span>

<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">CREATE</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">PRO=
CEDURE</span> ProcessBonuses()
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">BEGIN</span>
    <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">DECLARE</span> v_emp_id <span class=3D"hlj=
s-type">INT</span>;
    <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">DECLARE</span> v_salary <span class=3D"hlj=
s-type">DECIMAL</span>(<span class=3D"hljs-number">10</span>,<span class=3D=
"hljs-number">2</span>);
    <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">DECLARE</span> v_bonus <span class=3D"hljs=
-type">DECIMAL</span>(<span class=3D"hljs-number">10</span>,<span class=3D"=
hljs-number">2</span>);
    <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">DECLARE</span> done <span class=3D"hljs-ty=
pe">INT</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">DEFAULT</span> <span class=3D"h=
ljs-number">0</span>;

    <span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- Declare cursor</span>
    <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">DECLARE</span> emp_cursor <span class=3D"h=
ljs-keyword">CURSOR</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">FOR</span>
        <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">SELECT</span> emp_id, salary <span cla=
ss=3D"hljs-keyword">FROM</span> employees;

    <span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- Handler for end of result set</span>
    <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">DECLARE</span> CONTINUE HANDLER <span clas=
s=3D"hljs-keyword">FOR</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">NOT</span> FOUND=
 <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">SET</span> done <span class=3D"hljs-operator"=
>=3D</span> <span class=3D"hljs-number">1</span>;

    <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">OPEN</span> emp_cursor;

    read_loop: LOOP
        <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">FETCH</span> emp_cursor <span class=3D=
"hljs-keyword">INTO</span> v_emp_id, v_salary;
        IF done <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">THEN</span>
            LEAVE read_loop;
        <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">END</span> IF;

        <span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- Custom logic</span>
        IF v_salary <span class=3D"hljs-operator">&lt;</span> <span class=
=3D"hljs-number">50000</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">THEN</span>
            <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">SET</span> v_bonus <span class=3D"=
hljs-operator">=3D</span> v_salary <span class=3D"hljs-operator">*</span> <=
span class=3D"hljs-number">0.10</span>;
        <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">ELSE</span>
            <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">SET</span> v_bonus <span class=3D"=
hljs-operator">=3D</span> v_salary <span class=3D"hljs-operator">*</span> <=
span class=3D"hljs-number">0.05</span>;
        <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">END</span> IF;

        <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">UPDATE</span> employees <span class=3D=
"hljs-keyword">SET</span> bonus <span class=3D"hljs-operator">=3D</span> v_=
bonus <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">WHERE</span> emp_id <span class=3D"hljs-=
operator">=3D</span> v_emp_id;
    <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">END</span> LOOP;

    <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">CLOSE</span> emp_cursor;
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">END</span> <span class=3D"hljs-operator">/</sp=
an><span class=3D"hljs-operator">/</span>

DELIMITER ;

<span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- Call it</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">CALL</span> ProcessBonuses();</code></pre></di=
v>
