<h3 id=3D"1-trivial-functional-dependency" data-toc=3D"1. Trivial Functiona=
l Dependency">1. Trivial Functional Dependency</h3>
<p>A dependency <code>X =E2=86=92 Y</code> is <strong>trivial</strong> if Y=
 is a <strong>subset of X</strong> (i.e., Y is already part of X). It's alw=
ays true =E2=80=94 you're not learning anything new.</p>
<div class=3D"markdown-alert markdown-alert-note"><p class=3D"markdown-aler=
t-title"><svg class=3D"octicon octicon-info mr-2" viewBox=3D"0 0 16 16" ver=
