<h3 id=3D"2-non-trivial-functional-dependency" data-toc=3D"2. Non-Trivial F=
unctional Dependency">2. Non-Trivial Functional Dependency</h3>
<p>A dependency <code>X =E2=86=92 Y</code> is <strong>non-trivial</strong> =
if Y is <strong>NOT a subset of X</strong> =E2=80=94 i.e., Y contains at le=
ast one attribute that is NOT in X. These are the useful, meaningful depend=
encies.</p>
<h4 id=3D"rule-x--y-is-non-trivial-if-y--x">Rule: <code>X =E2=86=92 Y</code=
> is non-trivial if <code>Y =E2=8A=84 X</code></h4>
<h4 id=3D"examples-4">Examples</h4>
<div class=3D"tbl"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Dependency</th>
<th style=3D"text-align:center">Non-Trivial?</th>
<th>Why</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>roll_no =E2=86=92 name</code></td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9C=85 Non-Trivial</td>
<td><code>name</code> is NOT part of <code>roll_no</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>roll_no =E2=86=92 name, dept</code></td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9C=85 Non-Trivial</td>
<td><code>name, dept</code> are NOT part of <code>roll_no</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>course_id =E2=86=92 course_name</code></td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9C=85 Non-Trivial</td>
<td><code>course_name</code> is NOT part of <code>course_id</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>{roll_no, name} =E2=86=92 name</code></td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9D=8C Trivial</td>
<td><code>name</code> IS part of <code>{roll_no, name}</code></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
<h4 id=3D"completely-non-trivial">Completely Non-Trivial</h4>
<p>A special case =E2=80=94 when there is <strong>zero overlap</strong> bet=
ween X and Y:</p>
<div class=3D"tbl"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Dependency</th>
<th style=3D"text-align:center">Completely Non-Trivial?</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>roll_no =E2=86=92 name</code></td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9C=85 No overlap at all</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>{roll_no, name} =E2=86=92 dept</code></td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9C=85 <code>dept</code> has no overlap =
with <code>{roll_no, name}</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>{roll_no, name} =E2=86=92 name, dept</code></td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9D=8C <code>name</code> overlaps (parti=
ally non-trivial)</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
