<h3 id=3D"3-full-functional-dependency-fully-functional" data-toc=3D"3. Ful=
l Functional Dependency (Fully Functional)">3. Full Functional Dependency (=
Fully Functional)</h3>
<p>A dependency <code>X =E2=86=92 Y</code> is <strong>full</strong> if Y de=
pends on the <strong>entire</strong> X, and removing any attribute from X b=
reaks the dependency.</p>
