<h3 id=3D"5-transitive-functional-dependency" data-toc=3D"5. Transitive Fun=
ctional Dependency">5. Transitive Functional Dependency</h3>
<p>A dependency <code>X =E2=86=92 Z</code> is <strong>transitive</strong> i=
f there exists an intermediate attribute Y such that <code>X =E2=86=92 Y</c=
ode> and <code>Y =E2=86=92 Z</code>, but Y does NOT determine X.</p>
<div class=3D"markdown-alert markdown-alert-note"><p class=3D"markdown-aler=
