<td>Dr. Gupta</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
<p>Notice the <strong>redundancy</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li><code>&quot;Computer Science&quot;</code> and <code>&quot;Dr. Gupta&quo=
t;</code> appear in <strong>4 rows</strong></li>
<li><code>&quot;Data Structures&quot;</code> and <code>&quot;Prof. Sharma&q=
uot;</code> appear in <strong>3 rows</strong></li>
<li>Alice's name appears in <strong>2 rows</strong></li>
</ul>
<p>This redundancy is the root cause of all three anomalies.</p>
