<th>CourseID</th>
<th>CourseName</th>
<th>Instructor</th>
<th>Department</th>
<th>DeptHead</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>101</td>
<td>Alice</td>
<td>CS101</td>
<td>Data Structures</td>
<td>Prof. Sharma</td>
<td>Computer Science</td>
<td><s>Dr. Gupta</s> =E2=86=92 <strong>Dr. Mehta</strong></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>101</td>
<td>Alice</td>
<td>CS102</td>
<td>Algorithms</td>
<td>Prof. Verma</td>
<td>Computer Science</td>
<td><s>Dr. Gupta</s> =E2=86=92 <strong>Dr. Mehta</strong></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>102</td>
<td>Bob</td>
<td>CS101</td>
<td>Data Structures</td>
<td>Prof. Sharma</td>
<td>Computer Science</td>
<td><s>Dr. Gupta</s> =E2=86=92 <strong>Dr. Mehta</strong></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>103</td>
<td>Carol</td>
<td>CS101</td>
<td>Data Structures</td>
<td>Prof. Sharma</td>
<td>Computer Science</td>
<td><s>Dr. Gupta</s> =E2=86=92 <strong>Dr. Mehta</strong></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
<p>That's <strong>4 rows</strong> to update for a <strong>single real-world=
 change</strong>. If you update only 3 of them:</p>
<div class=3D"tbl"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>StudentID</th>
<th>StudentName</th>
<th>CourseID</th>
<th>CourseName</th>
<th>Instructor</th>
<th>Department</th>
<th>DeptHead</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>101</td>
<td>Alice</td>
<td>CS101</td>
<td>Data Structures</td>
<td>Prof. Sharma</td>
<td>Computer Science</td>
<td><strong>Dr. Mehta</strong> =E2=9C=85</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>101</td>
<td>Alice</td>
<td>CS102</td>
<td>Algorithms</td>
<td>Prof. Verma</td>
<td>Computer Science</td>
<td><strong>Dr. Mehta</strong> =E2=9C=85</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>102</td>
<td>Bob</td>
<td>CS101</td>
<td>Data Structures</td>
<td>Prof. Sharma</td>
<td>Computer Science</td>
<td><strong>Dr. Gupta</strong> =E2=9D=8C</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>103</td>
<td>Carol</td>
<td>CS101</td>
<td>Data Structures</td>
<td>Prof. Sharma</td>
<td>Computer Science</td>
<td><strong>Dr. Mehta</strong> =E2=9C=85</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
<p>Now the database says <strong>two different things</strong> =E2=80=94 Bo=
b's row says Dr. Gupta is the head, while everyone else says Dr. Mehta. <st=
rong>Which is correct?</strong> The database is now <strong>inconsistent</s=
trong>.</p>
<p><strong>The anomaly:</strong> A single fact is stored in multiple places=
, so updating it requires touching every copy. Missing one creates contradi=
ctory data.</p>
