p><strong>The key insight:</strong> Anomalies aren't a separate problem to =
be patched =E2=80=94 they're the observable symptom of <strong>poor table d=
esign</strong> (redundancy). Normalization eliminates redundancy by ensurin=
g each independent fact lives in exactly one place. This is why normalizati=
on (1NF =E2=86=92 2NF =E2=86=92 3NF =E2=86=92 BCNF) exists =E2=80=94 it sys=
