<h4 id=3D"3nf-vs-bcnf">3NF vs BCNF</h4>
<div class=3D"tbl"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th></th>
<th>3NF</th>
<th>BCNF</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Condition on <code>X =E2=86=92 Y</code></td>
<td>X is a super key <strong>OR</strong> Y is prime</td>
<td>X <strong>must</strong> be a super key</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Strength</td>
<td>Weaker</td>
<td>Stronger (3NF =E2=8A=87 BCNF)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Lossless decomposition</td>
<td>Always achievable</td>
<td>Always achievable</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Dependency preservation</td>
<td><strong>Always</strong> achievable</td>
<td><strong>Not always</strong> achievable</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Redundancy left</td>
<td>Some (when candidate keys overlap)</td>
<td>Essentially none from FDs</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
