<h4 id=3D"3-isolation--transactions-dont-interfere">3. Isolation =E2=80=94 =
&quot;Transactions Don't Interfere&quot;</h4>
<p>Even when multiple transactions run <strong>concurrently</strong>, each =
transaction must behave as if it's the <strong>only one</strong> running. O=
ne transaction's intermediate state must NOT be visible to another.</p>
