<h3 id=3D"schedules--serializability" data-toc=3D"Schedules &amp; Serializa=
bility">Schedules &amp; Serializability</h3>
<p>How concurrent transactions are ordered (serial vs. concurrent schedules=
), how to tell whether an interleaving is safe (conflicting operations, con=
flict &amp; view serializability, the precedence-graph test) and recoverabi=
lity (recoverable, cascadeless, strict) are covered once, in <a href=3D"#ty=
pes-of-schedules-in-dbms">Types of Schedules in DBMS</a>.</p>
