<h3 id=3D"2-rollback" data-toc=3D"2. ROLLBACK">2. ROLLBACK</h3>
<p><strong>Undoes all changes</strong> made since the <code>BEGIN TRANSACTI=
ON</code> (or since the last <code>COMMIT</code>). The database reverts to =
its previous consistent state.</p>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">SQL</span></div><pre><code class=3D"=
hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">ROLLBACK</span>;</code></pre></div>
<h4 id=3D"example--failed-transfer">Example =E2=80=94 Failed Transfer</h4>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">SQL</span></div><pre><code class=3D"=
hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">BEGIN</span> TRANSACTION;

<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">UPDATE</span> accounts <span class=3D"hljs-key=
word">SET</span> balance <span class=3D"hljs-operator">=3D</span> balance <=
span class=3D"hljs-operator">-</span> <span class=3D"hljs-number">500</span=
> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">WHERE</span> name <span class=3D"hljs-operat=
or">=3D</span> <span class=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;Alice&#x27;</span>;  <span=
 class=3D"hljs-comment">-- Debit =E2=9C=85</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- Oops! Bob&#x27;s account is frozen, credit =
fails</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">UPDATE</span> accounts <span class=3D"hljs-key=
word">SET</span> balance <span class=3D"hljs-operator">=3D</span> balance <=
span class=3D"hljs-operator">+</span> <span class=3D"hljs-number">500</span=
> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">WHERE</span> name <span class=3D"hljs-operat=
or">=3D</span> <span class=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;Bob&#x27;</span>;    <span=
 class=3D"hljs-comment">-- ERROR! =E2=9D=8C</span>

<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">ROLLBACK</span>;   <span class=3D"hljs-comment=
">-- Undo EVERYTHING =E2=80=94 Alice gets her =E2=82=B9500 back</span></cod=
e></pre></div>
