<hr>
<h3 id=3D"3-savepoint" data-toc=3D"3. SAVEPOINT">3. SAVEPOINT</h3>
<p>Creates a <strong>checkpoint</strong> within a transaction. You can <cod=
e>ROLLBACK TO</code> a savepoint to undo only the changes made <strong>afte=
r</strong> that savepoint, while keeping earlier changes intact.</p>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">SQL</span></div><pre><code class=3D"=
hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">SAVEPOINT</span> savepoint_name;        =
      <span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- Create checkpoint</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">ROLLBACK</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">T=
O</span> savepoint_name;            <span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- Undo to=
 checkpoint (also written ROLLBACK TO SAVEPOINT savepoint_name)</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">RELEASE</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">SA=
VEPOINT</span> savepoint_name;      <span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- Delete =
checkpoint (optional)</span></code></pre></div>
<h4 id=3D"example--partial-rollback">Example =E2=80=94 Partial Rollback</h4=
>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">SQL</span></div><pre><code class=3D"=
hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">BEGIN</span> TRANSACTION;

<span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- Step 1: Transfer from Alice to Bob</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">UPDATE</span> accounts <span class=3D"hljs-key=
word">SET</span> balance <span class=3D"hljs-operator">=3D</span> balance <=
span class=3D"hljs-operator">-</span> <span class=3D"hljs-number">500</span=
> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">WHERE</span> name <span class=3D"hljs-operat=
or">=3D</span> <span class=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;Alice&#x27;</span>;
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">UPDATE</span> accounts <span class=3D"hljs-key=
word">SET</span> balance <span class=3D"hljs-operator">=3D</span> balance <=
span class=3D"hljs-operator">+</span> <span class=3D"hljs-number">500</span=
> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">WHERE</span> name <span class=3D"hljs-operat=
or">=3D</span> <span class=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;Bob&#x27;</span>;

<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">SAVEPOINT</span> transfer_done;   <span class=
=3D"hljs-comment">-- =E2=86=90 Checkpoint: Alice=E2=86=92Bob is safe</span>

<span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- Step 2: Transfer from Bob to Carol (this fa=
ils)</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">UPDATE</span> accounts <span class=3D"hljs-key=
word">SET</span> balance <span class=3D"hljs-operator">=3D</span> balance <=
span class=3D"hljs-operator">-</span> <span class=3D"hljs-number">200</span=
> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">WHERE</span> name <span class=3D"hljs-operat=
or">=3D</span> <span class=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;Bob&#x27;</span>;
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">UPDATE</span> accounts <span class=3D"hljs-key=
word">SET</span> balance <span class=3D"hljs-operator">=3D</span> balance <=
span class=3D"hljs-operator">+</span> <span class=3D"hljs-number">200</span=
> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">WHERE</span> name <span class=3D"hljs-operat=
or">=3D</span> <span class=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;Carol&#x27;</span>;   <spa=
n class=3D"hljs-comment">-- ERROR!</span>

<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">ROLLBACK</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">T=
O</span> transfer_done;  <span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- =E2=86=90 Undo onl=
y Step 2, keep Step 1</span>

<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">COMMIT</span>;   <span class=3D"hljs-comment">=
-- Alice=E2=86=92Bob transfer is committed</span></code></pre></div>
