<h4 id=3D"example--undo-a-failed-step-and-retry-it">Example =E2=80=94 Undo =
a Failed Step and Retry It</h4>
<p>A savepoint also lets you retry just the step that failed, without redoi=
ng the work before it:</p>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">SQL</span></div><pre><code class=3D"=
hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">BEGIN</span> TRANSACTION;

<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">UPDATE</span> accounts <span class=3D"hljs-key=
word">SET</span> balance <span class=3D"hljs-operator">=3D</span> balance <=
span class=3D"hljs-operator">-</span> <span class=3D"hljs-number">500</span=
> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">WHERE</span> id <span class=3D"hljs-operator=
">=3D</span> <span class=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;A&#x27;</span>;
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">SAVEPOINT</span> after_debit;

<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">UPDATE</span> accounts <span class=3D"hljs-key=
word">SET</span> balance <span class=3D"hljs-operator">=3D</span> balance <=
span class=3D"hljs-operator">+</span> <span class=3D"hljs-number">500</span=
> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">WHERE</span> id <span class=3D"hljs-operator=
">=3D</span> <span class=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;B&#x27;</span>;

<span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- Oops, something went wrong with credit</spa=
n>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">ROLLBACK</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">T=
O</span> after_debit;  <span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- only undoes the cred=
it, keeps the debit</span>

<span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- Fix and retry</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">UPDATE</span> accounts <span class=3D"hljs-key=
word">SET</span> balance <span class=3D"hljs-operator">=3D</span> balance <=
span class=3D"hljs-operator">+</span> <span class=3D"hljs-number">500</span=
> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">WHERE</span> id <span class=3D"hljs-operator=
">=3D</span> <span class=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;B&#x27;</span>;

<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">COMMIT</span>;  <span class=3D"hljs-comment">-=
- make everything permanent</span></code></pre></div>
