<h4 id=3D"how-its-enforced--application-logic--dbms-constraints">How It's E=
nforced =E2=80=94 Application Logic + DBMS Constraints</h4>
<p>Consistency is a <strong>shared responsibility</strong> =E2=80=94 partly=
 the developer's job, partly the DBMS's job.</p>
<div class=3D"tbl"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Enforced By</th>
<th>How</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><strong>Application logic</strong></td>
<td>Developer writes correct transaction logic (e.g., debit + credit =3D 0)=
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Integrity constraints</strong></td>
<td>PK, FK, UNIQUE, NOT NULL, CHECK constraints</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Triggers</strong></td>
<td>Auto-validate data on INSERT/UPDATE</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Domain constraints</strong></td>
<td>Data type checks (INT, VARCHAR, etc.)</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
