 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z"></path></svg>Note</p><p><strong>The link between them:=
</strong> Consistency is enforced <strong>by</strong> integrity constraints=
. If a transaction would leave the database violating any integrity constra=
int, the DBMS aborts and rolls it back =E2=80=94 that rollback <em>is</em> =
consistency in action.</p>
</div>
