<h3 id=3D"summary-3" data-toc=3D"Summary">Summary</h3>
<div class=3D"tbl"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Question</th>
<th>Answer</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>What is <strong>integrity</strong>?</td>
<td>The correctness and validity of data, enforced by constraints (Entity, =
Referential, Domain, User-defined)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>What is <strong>consistency</strong>?</td>
<td>The guarantee that every transaction moves the DB from one valid state =
to another, never breaking any rule</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>How are they related?</td>
<td>Integrity defines the rules; consistency enforces them across transacti=
ons</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Which ACID property is <em>partly the developer's job</em>?</td>
<td><strong>Consistency</strong> =E2=80=94 the DBMS enforces declared const=
raints, but you must write transaction logic that actually preserves busine=
ss rules</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
