 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z"></path></svg>Note</p><p><strong>Complete schedule:</st=
rong> a schedule is <em>complete</em> when every transaction in it has ende=
d with either a <strong>commit</strong> or an <strong>abort</strong> =E2=80=
=94 no transaction is left in-flight. All the types below are discussed as =
complete schedules.</p>
