<h4 id=3D"reading-the-tree--two-separate-questions">Reading the Tree =E2=80=
=94 Two Separate Questions</h4>
<p>Every schedule gets judged on <strong>two independent questions</strong>=
:</p>
<div class=3D"tbl"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Question</th>
<th>Asks</th>
<th>Answered by</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><strong>Serializability</strong></td>
<td><em>If every transaction commits, is the final result the same as runni=
ng them one at a time?</em></td>
<td>Serial / Serializable / Non-Serializable</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Recoverability</strong></td>
<td><em>If a transaction <strong>aborts</strong>, can we undo it cleanly wi=
thout breaking anything already committed?</em></td>
<td>Non-Recoverable / Recoverable / Cascadeless / Strict</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
