<p>Non-serial schedules are divided into <strong>serializable</strong> and =
<strong>non-serializable</strong>.</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"3-serializable-schedule" data-toc=3D"3. Serializable Schedule">3.=
 Serializable Schedule</h3>
<p>A non-serial (concurrent) schedule is <strong>serializable</strong> if i=
t produces the <strong>same result</strong> as some serial schedule. Serial=
izability is the <strong>gold standard</strong> for correctness: concurrent=
 but correct.</p>
