<h3 id=3D"3a-conflict-serializability" data-toc=3D"3a. Conflict Serializabi=
lity">3a. Conflict Serializability</h3>
<p>A schedule is <strong>conflict serializable</strong> if it can be conver=
ted into a serial schedule by <strong>swapping non-conflicting operations</=
strong>.</p>
<h4 id=3D"conflicting-operations">Conflicting Operations</h4>
<p>Two operations <strong>conflict</strong> if ALL three conditions are met=
:</p>
<ol>
<li>They belong to <strong>different transactions</strong></li>
<li>They access the <strong>same data item</strong></li>
<li>At least one is a <strong>write</strong> operation</li>
</ol>
<div class=3D"tbl"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th style=3D"text-align:center">T1 Op</th>
<th style=3D"text-align:center">T2 Op</th>
<th style=3D"text-align:center">Same Item?</th>
<th style=3D"text-align:center">Conflict?</th>
<th>Why</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">Read(A)</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">Read(A)</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9C=85</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9D=8C</td>
<td>Both are reads =E2=80=94 no conflict</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">Read(A)</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">Write(A)</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9C=85</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9C=85</td>
<td>One is write =E2=80=94 <strong>Read-Write conflict</strong></td>
</tr>
<tr>
