<td style=3D"text-align:center">Write(A)</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9C=85</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9C=85</td>
<td>Both are writes =E2=80=94 <strong>Write-Write conflict</strong></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">Read(A)</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">Write(B)</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9D=8C</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9D=8C</td>
<td>Different items =E2=80=94 no conflict</td>
</tr>
<tr>
