<h4 id=3D"non-conflicting-operations-can-be-swapped">Non-Conflicting Operat=
ions Can Be Swapped</h4>
<p>If two adjacent operations are <strong>non-conflicting</strong>, you can=
 swap their order without changing the result. By repeatedly swapping, you =
can try to convert a concurrent schedule into a serial one.</p>
