<h3 id=3D"3b-view-serializability" data-toc=3D"3b. View Serializability">3b=
. View Serializability</h3>
<h4 id=3D"view-equivalence">View Equivalence</h4>
<p>Two schedules S and S' are <strong>view equivalent</strong> if all three=
 conditions hold. A schedule S is <strong>view serializable</strong> if it =
is view equivalent to some serial schedule S'.</p>
<div class=3D"tbl"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Condition</th>
<th>Rule</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><strong>Initial Read</strong></td>
<td>If Ti reads the initial value of X in S, Ti also reads the initial valu=
e of X in S'</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Updated Read</strong></td>
<td>If Ti reads a value written by Tj in S, Ti also reads the value written=
 by Tj in S'</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Final Write</strong></td>
<td>If Ti performs the last write on X in S, Ti also performs the last writ=
e on X in S'</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
