75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.19l2.72-2.72a.749.749 0 0 1 .53-.22h6.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .=
25-.25v-9.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25Zm7 2.25v2.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-2.5a.75.75=
 0 0 1 1.5 0ZM9 9a1 1 0 1 1-2 0 1 1 0 0 1 2 0Z"></path></svg>Important</p><=
p><strong>Key insight:</strong> View serializability is <strong>less restri=
ctive</strong> than conflict serializability =E2=80=94 some schedules that =
are NOT conflict-serializable may still be view-serializable. It allows mor=
e schedules, but is harder to test (NP-complete).</p>
