<h4 id=3D"4c-cascading-schedule-recoverable-but-risky">4c. Cascading Schedu=
le (Recoverable but Risky)</h4>
<p>Recoverable, but failure of one transaction causes a <strong>chain of ro=
llbacks</strong> (cascade abort): if T1 rolls back and T2 read T1's data, T=
2 must also roll back; if T3 read T2's data, T3 rolls back too =E2=86=92 <s=
trong>cascade</strong>.</p>
