0 1.5h-2a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h.25v-2h-.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75ZM8 6a1 1 0 1 1=
 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z"></path></svg>Note</p><p>The job of <strong>isolation l=
evels</strong> and <strong>concurrency control protocols</strong> is to kee=
p these advantages while eliminating the problems above.</p>
</div>
