<h3 id=3D"sql-isolation-levels" data-toc=3D"SQL Isolation Levels">SQL Isola=
tion Levels</h3>
<p>SQL defines <strong>4 isolation levels</strong> that control which concu=
rrency problems are allowed:</p>
<div class=3D"tbl"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Isolation Level</th>
<th style=3D"text-align:center">Dirty Read</th>
<th style=3D"text-align:center">Lost Update</th>
<th style=3D"text-align:center">Non-Repeatable Read</th>
<th style=3D"text-align:center">Phantom Read</th>
<th style=3D"text-align:center">Performance</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><strong>READ UNCOMMITTED</strong></td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9A=A0=EF=B8=8F Possible</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9A=A0=EF=B8=8F Possible</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9A=A0=EF=B8=8F Possible</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9A=A0=EF=B8=8F Possible</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">Fastest</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>READ COMMITTED</strong></td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9C=85 Prevented</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9A=A0=EF=B8=8F Possible</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9A=A0=EF=B8=8F Possible</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9A=A0=EF=B8=8F Possible</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">Fast</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>REPEATABLE READ</strong></td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9C=85 Prevented</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9C=85 Prevented*</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9C=85 Prevented</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9A=A0=EF=B8=8F Possible</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">Balanced</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>SERIALIZABLE</strong></td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9C=85 Prevented</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9C=85 Prevented</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9C=85 Prevented</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9C=85 Prevented</td>
<td style=3D"text-align:center">Slowest</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
