"hljs">  Scenario 1: Multiple Readers (OK)
  T1: S-Lock(A) =E2=9C=85
  T2: S-Lock(A) =E2=9C=85    Both can read simultaneously
  T3: S-Lock(A) =E2=9C=85

  Scenario 2: Reader + Writer (BLOCKED)
  T1: S-Lock(A) =E2=9C=85
  T2: X-Lock(A) =E2=9D=8C WAIT   T2 must wait for T1 to release

  Scenario 3: Writer + Writer (BLOCKED)
  T1: X-Lock(A) =E2=9C=85
  T2: X-Lock(A) =E2=9D=8C WAIT   Only one writer at a time</code></pre></di=
