<h4 id=3D"pre-claiming-lock-protocol">Pre-Claiming Lock Protocol</h4>
<p>Before execution, the transaction requests <strong>ALL locks it will nee=
d</strong> at once.</p>
<ul>
<li>If ALL locks are granted =E2=86=92 execute the transaction =E2=86=92 re=
lease all at end</li>
<li>If ANY lock is denied =E2=86=92 <strong>rollback</strong> and wait =E2=
=86=92 retry later</li>
</ul>
