<h3 id=3D"2-two-phase-locking-2pl" data-toc=3D"2. Two-Phase Locking (2PL)">=
2. Two-Phase Locking (2PL)</h3>
<p>The most widely used protocol. A transaction has <strong>two phases</str=
ong>:</p>
<ol>
<li><strong>Growing Phase</strong> =E2=80=94 can acquire locks, <strong>can=
not release</strong> any</li>
<li><strong>Shrinking Phase</strong> =E2=80=94 can release locks, <strong>c=
annot acquire</strong> any</li>
</ol>
