<h3 id=3D"4-optimistic-concurrency-control-validation-based" data-toc=3D"4.=
 Optimistic Concurrency Control (Validation-Based)">4. Optimistic Concurren=
cy Control (Validation-Based)</h3>
<p>Assumes conflicts are <strong>rare</strong>. Transactions execute freely=
 without any locks or checks. Only at the <strong>end</strong> (validation =
phase), the system checks if any conflict occurred.</p>
