</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style=3D"text-align:center"><strong>Read Phase</strong></td>
<td>Reads from DB, all writes go to a <strong>local buffer</strong> (not th=
e actual DB)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style=3D"text-align:center"><strong>Validation Phase</strong></td>
<td>Check if any other transaction modified the same data =E2=86=92 conflic=
t?</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style=3D"text-align:center"><strong>Write Phase</strong></td>
<td>If validation passes, apply local changes to the database</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
