m/" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener">Recovery from Deadlock</a></p>
<p>A <strong>deadlock</strong> occurs when two or more transactions are <st=
rong>waiting for each other</strong> to release locks, creating a circular =
wait. None can proceed.</p>
